# LF everywhere, on every OS. A Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true on the
# GitHub runners) would otherwise turn the fixtures into CRLF and break the
# byte-for-byte JSON tests against song.json / song.min.json / flat_notes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Golden fixtures produced by the JS app: compared byte for byte, never rewritten.
crates/ordrumbox-core/tests/fixtures/** -text
